                <pb facs="0772" n="658" sameAs="frus:frus1943/pg658"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">842.24/245</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the President </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1943-08-13">August 13, 1943</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#center">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Memorandum for the President</hi>
                </p>
                <p>Reference is made to Mr. Early’s memorandum of August 11 transmitting a
                    memorandum dated August 3 from Mr. Lauchlin Currie in regard to a proposed
                    statement concerning the Joint War Aid Committee, United States–Canada.</p>
                <p>The proposed statement quoted in Mr. Early’s memorandum is satisfactory to the
                    Department of State.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>C[<hi rendition="#small-caps">ordell</hi>] H[<hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >ull</hi>]</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
